tv*w] + 
  w^2*Sqrt[(gamma - wn)*(gamma + wn)]*Sin[phi] + E^(2*tv*Sqrt[gamma^2 - \
wn^2])*w^2*Sqrt[(gamma - wn)*(gamma + wn)]*Sin[phi] - wn^2*Sqrt[(gamma - \
wn)*(gamma + wn)]*Sin[phi] - E^(2*tv*Sqrt[gamma^2 - wn^2])*wn^2*Sqrt[(gamma - \
wn)*(gamma + wn)]*Sin[phi] + 
  (-1 + E^(2*tv*Sqrt[gamma^2 - wn^2]))*(w*(2*gamma^2 + w^2 - wn^2)*Cos[phi] - \
gamma*(w^2 + wn^2)*Sin[phi]) - 2*E^(tv*(gamma + Sqrt[gamma^2 - \
wn^2]))*w^2*Sqrt[(gamma - wn)*(gamma + wn)]*Sin[phi + tv*w] + 
  2*E^(tv*(gamma + Sqrt[gamma^2 - wn^2]))*wn^2*Sqrt[(gamma - wn)*(gamma + \
wn)]*Sin[phi + tv*w])/(2*E^(tv*(gamma + Sqrt[gamma^2 - wn^2]))*Sqrt[(gamma - \
wn)*(gamma + wn)]*(4*gamma^2*w^2 + (w^2 - wn^2)^2))\
\>", "Output",
